# Bat Hunt (San d'Oria 1-2): Grilau in Northern San d'Oria. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with 1-1 completed, holding
# an Orcish Scale Mail and a Bat Fang. Section 1: Grilau's script plays 1009; its finish with option 101 begins the
# mission (Northern San d'Oria's own registration). Section 2 (status 0): Grilau plays 1021. Section 3 (status 2, a GM):
# Grilau plays 1022; the Orcish Scale Mail traded: 1023, whose finish completes it. Begun again and set to status 2: the
# Bat Fang traded: 1003, whose finish completes it again.
# Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Northern San d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the
# West onZoneIn, which returns 878 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1003 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1023
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-240.5,7,57.9 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
item OrcishMailScales
item BatFang
login
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: 1009
finish option=101                       # begun
trigger Grilau                          # section 2 (status 0): 1021
finish
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
trigger Grilau                          # section 3: 1022
finish
walk -241.5,7,57.9
trade Grilau OrcishMailScales x1        # 1023
finish                                  # completed
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: 1009
finish option=101                       # begun again
missionstatus Sandoria 2
trade Grilau BatFang x1                 # 1003
finish                                  # completed again
